    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nDear Evgeni,\n\nI run into a problem that this default mapping:\n```\nmappings = {\n    choose_marked     = '<M-CR>',\n}\n```\nconflicts with 3 popular applications I use neovim with:\n- alacritty\n- wezterm\n- Nvy\nwhere that key combination toggles window maximization /  full screen\n\nplease maybe consider changing the default to\n```\nmappings = {\n    choose_marked     = '<C-CR>',\n}\n```\nthat's what I did in my config and I'm fine now,\nbut it took me a while to figure out what's happening\n\nthat's it,\ntake care :)\n",
    "closed_at": "2025-06-13T09:00:57Z",
