    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nUnfortunately, there is no universally good default key combination here. As `<CR>` is the most reasonable default key for `choose` action, the default for `choose_marked` should also involve `<CR>`. That virtually leaves `<Shift>+<CR>`, `<Ctrl>+<CR>`, and `<Alt>+<CR>`. The first two have issues with not-so-modern terminals, as they are recognized as `<CR>`, so that's why `<M-CR>` (a.k.a. `<Alt>+<CR>`) was chosen.\n\nBesides, `<C-CR>` conflicts with Ghostty key combo for making it full screen (same as `<M-CR>` for WezTerm).\n\nClosing as not planned, as the key combo can be customized.",
            "created_at": "2025-06-13T09:00:57Z",
